LICENSE REVIEW REQUIRED

This directory is a release candidate prepared for the research authors' review.
No new open-source or open-data license is granted by this file.

Original project code, documentation, configurations and generated research outputs:
  Ownership and institutional/contractual redistribution authority were not established
  by the audited artifacts. MIT or BSD-3-Clause is a proposed code-license choice only.

Vehicle measurements and derived vehicle replay data:
  Explicit recording-consent, institutional/project ownership and public-data release
  permission records were not found. CC BY 4.0 is a proposed data-license choice only.
  De-identification does not resolve ownership or consent requirements.

Residual RL checkpoint:
  Not included. The exact hash and deployment metadata are supplied in checkpoints/.
  Redistribution requires confirmation from the authorized owner.

Synthetic VLM snapshots and VLM response artifacts:
  Preserve research provenance; confirm applicable simulator-asset and provider
  redistribution terms before release.

Third-party notices and licenses remain in force for their respective materials.
See NOTICE and docs/CARLA_LICENSE.txt. The CARLA license does not establish the
ownership or license of this project's untracked modifications or vehicle data.
